## Module types

- \ref laplace::distrib::multinomial_distrib "multinomial_distrib" — multinomial distribution of size \f$N\f$ and probabilities \f$\mu\f$ in additive log-ratio coordinates
- \ref laplace::distrib::multinomial_state "multinomial_state" — empty state type returned by `theta_state()`

## References

- N. L. Johnson, S. Kotz and N. Balakrishnan (1997), Discrete Multivariate Distributions, Wiley.
